    ------     ----                   ----               -------\n  Normal   Scheduled  5m1s                   default-scheduler  Successfully assigned hotel-reservation/recommendation-64754c9c4f-9kgzp to node0.htliang2-agent.insai-pg0.apt.emulab.net\n  Warning  BackOff    3m46s                  kubelet            spec.containers{hotel-reserv-recommendation}: Back-off restarting failed container hotel-reserv-recommendation in pod recommendation-64754c9c4f-9kgzp_hotel-reservation(b5954dc2-0eec-4205-97b6-05ebfcb5592f)\n  Normal   Pulled     3m39s (x3 over 4m47s)  kubelet            spec.containers{hotel-reserv-recommendation}: Container image "yinfangchen/hotelreservation:latest" already present on machine\n  Normal   Created    3m32s (x3 over 4m37s)  kubelet            spec.containers{hotel-reserv-recommendation}: Created container: hotel-reserv-recommendation\n  Normal   Started    3m30s (x3 over 4m33s)  kubelet            spec.containers{hotel-reserv-recommendation}: Started container hotel-reserv-recommendation\n', id='a4a2d623-006f-4074-9f5b-34510108fabd', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-8b869ca5f0d0d57b'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='8b61ab09-e176-4e5e-a757-165a6be0f621')]]
